			"Message": "chore(Land): Sync Element submodule to latest revisions\n\nUpdate the Element git submodule from a611a77 to b05f7f5 to incorporate recent architectural refinements across the editor's core components.\n\nThis synchronization integrates the latest PascalCase naming enforcement in Mountain, improved parameter extraction utilities in the IPC layer, and updated build artifacts from Rest/Output. It ensures the main Land repository aligns with the current state of Common, Echo, Maintain, Rest, and SideCar submodules, maintaining build consistency and adherence to CLAUDE.md standards.",
			"SHA": "0d4c9e1606f4c51dc8173995f77b94b69fcc5efe"
		},
